S7  Contract only: the 10x ceiling on a free-mode reserve vs E2/E3 for a 1x long shot
====================================================================================================
1x YES at 0.05, margin 1,000: outright win would be 19,000.00; reserve locked 10,000.00
at 0.55 held for 2 h (exactly the 10x line): collectable = False (slow is 23054796 wei short of the mid; P&L at the close price is 1 micro-USDC under the cap)
at 0.56 held for 30 min: collectable by anyone = True (E3: 1x positions stay open through resolution)
resolves YES: vault marks 1,981,000.00 vs clamped 1,990,000.00 (mis-mark 9,000.00); alice is paid a profit of 10,000.00 before the 10% share, not 19,000.00

